<p local-id=3D"c8babc40017a">Semantics: see use case</p>
<p local-id=3D"869e9b217fc8">Analysis: anticipated but not acquired bag at =
final reconcile is an incident that needs to be notified to parties. It is =
an alert, rather than result to previous instructions. Hence mapping to Bag=
NotifRQ. Process: T; Load: Reconcile plus BaggageState-Incident</p>
<p local-id=3D"aa8cbbf253e7">Result: <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"htt=
ps://iataonline.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/IATABaggageWorkingGroup/Shared%2=
0Documents/Baggage%20Information%20Exchange%20(BIX)%20Sub%20Group/Taskforce=
%20best%20practices%20BIX%20v2/Samples/source%20RP1745/7.9.1%20Type-B%20Bag=
gage%20Not%20Seen%20Message.xml?d=3Dw52e1bb4f8a184a4a9a2e51a4f3cece08&amp;c=
sf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DRD8ff4" rel=3D"nofollow">7.9.1 Type-B Baggage No=
t Seen Message</a></p>
<h3 local-id=3D"900b6a586ed8" id=3D"id-7.9BNSmessages-secondpasscompleted-7=
.9.2BaggageNotSeenmultipleelements"><strong>7.9.2 Baggage Not Seen multiple=
 elements</strong></h3>
