=E2=80=83Baggage Not Seen Message, sent to the final destination of the pas=
senger, one message per leg - not relevant here</span></strong></h3>
<p local-id=3D"d4e4c3482c92">Use case: Notify Lost Luggage offices on bag i=
tinerary that bag is not seen while loading originating flight</p>
